 $8E84 RET             ; Return.

; Action: Check The Object Flags
;
; Used by the routines at #R$8D9D and #R$8F3B.
; .
; Checks the object's attributes and volume against the move volume at #R$8D9C and the
; current location at #R$8D9B before a move is allowed.
