; Table: Object Handlers
;
; Records of #N$07 bytes: an id, a flag, a handler, another flag and a second handler. #N$FF at #R$CACA ends the list. The #N$BF bytes from here to #R$CB42 take in this table and the Special Object Records at #R$CACB, each with its terminator. #R$6C1F copies them to #R$5F1D and #R$6C5D copies them back for a new game, and #R$8471, #R$8500 and #R$853C load, save and verify them. #R$96CB walks this table.
; Read by #R$6C00, #R$8451, #R$84CC and #R$96B3.
;
; .
;
; Barrel.
